From: Killy <308386066+killy-netsphere@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:37:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 177/211] 0170: TD -- the other card all-reduce ends its splits
 (lazy module loading / pageable uploads deadlocked on it), route bias twins
 uploaded before the next graph, pair all-reduce timeout

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pair-allreduce.cu | 34 +++++++++++++++++---
 src/llama-context.cpp                |  1 +
 src/llama-moe-cache.cpp              | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/llama-moe-cache.h                |  2 ++
 src/models/glm-dsa.cpp               | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 5 files changed, 109 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pair-allreduce.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pair-allreduce.cu
index cd92f7950..9a0c15c6c 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pair-allreduce.cu
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pair-allreduce.cu
@@ -22,6 +22,9 @@ struct ggml_cuda_pair_ar {
     float * host[2] = { nullptr, nullptr };          // rank r's staging: PAIR_AR_POOL slots (mapped pinned host memory)
